{
  "services": [
    {
      "name": "swap.v1.SwapService",
      "doc": "SwapService converts one asset of an account's Trading balance into another\n through Polyester's spot order books. A Swap executes as immediate-or-cancel\n spot orders on the account, at the account's spot taker fee and with no\n other fee, protected by the end-to-end min_amount_out the caller accepts:\n any part that trades nets at least that rate, and anything that cannot stays\n on the account. Quotes are estimates and reserve nothing.\n\n Requests are authenticated with a session token or a signed API key. The\n caller needs the SWAP permission on the account: the trading roles grant it\n on sub-accounts, and API keys and sub-account policies must include the SWAP\n action. A Swap's orders also remain subject to the sub-account's spot\n trading policy.\n\n Follow a Swap with GetSwap until is_terminal is true; a direct Swap usually\n completes within seconds.",
      "methods": [
        {
          "name": "CreateSwap",
          "path": "swap.v1.SwapService/CreateSwap",
          "requestType": "swap.v1.CreateSwapRequest",
          "responseType": "swap.v1.CreateSwapResponse",
          "summary": "CreateSwap creates the Swap for idempotency_key and executes it at once.",
          "doc": "CreateSwap creates the Swap for idempotency_key and executes it at once.\n It re-prices the terms against current depth first: the Swap is created\n only while the quote is unexpired and min_amount_out_e18 is achievable.\n It is idempotent per caller and key: a repeated or concurrent request with\n the same body returns the same Swap, so every unknown outcome is resolved\n by repeating the request unchanged.\n\n Errors:\n - INVALID_ARGUMENT: malformed request, AMOUNT_OUT_OF_RANGE or\n   INVALID_SUBACCOUNT_ID.\n - FAILED_PRECONDITION: ROUTE_UNSUPPORTED, DIRECTION_UNSUPPORTED,\n   PROTECTION_UNACHIEVABLE, QUOTE_EXPIRED or SUBACCOUNT_INACTIVE; nothing is\n   created.\n - ALREADY_EXISTS: IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT; the original Swap stands.\n - NOT_FOUND: SUBACCOUNT_NOT_FOUND.\n - PERMISSION_DENIED: SWAP_NOT_PERMITTED.\n - UNAVAILABLE, DEADLINE_EXCEEDED: QUOTE_UNAVAILABLE, SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE\n   or an unknown outcome; retry the same request.\n - UNAUTHENTICATED: missing or invalid credentials.",
          "authRequired": true,
          "authenticationMethods": [
            "session_token",
            "api_key"
          ],
          "mfaRequirement": "none",
          "stability": "stable",
          "errorProtoPkg": "swap.v1",
          "errorCatalog": "core:generic",
          "examples": {
            "request": {
              "idempotencyKey": "idem_01J5EXAMPLE0000000000000",
              "minAmountOutE18": {
                "hi": "1",
                "lo": "1"
              },
              "quoteExpiresAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
              "terms": {
                "amountE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "destinationAssetId": 100,
                "sourceAssetId": 100,
                "subaccountId": "6789012345678"
              }
            },
            "response": {
              "swap": {
                "amountE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "createdAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
                "destinationAssetId": 100,
                "executedAmountE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "feeE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "idempotencyKey": "idem_01J5EXAMPLE0000000000000",
                "isTerminal": false,
                "minAmountOutE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "orders": [
                  {
                    "feeE18": {
                      "hi": "1",
                      "lo": "1"
                    },
                    "leg": 1,
                    "limitPriceTicks": "5000000",
                    "orderId": "9876543210123",
                    "receivedE18": {
                      "hi": "1",
                      "lo": "1"
                    },
                    "side": "BUY",
                    "spentE18": {
                      "hi": "1",
                      "lo": "1"
                    },
                    "status": "PLACING",
                    "symbolId": 1
                  }
                ],
                "reason": "INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE",
                "receivedAmountE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                },
                "sourceAssetId": 100,
                "status": "EXECUTING",
                "subaccountId": "6789012345678",
                "swapId": "1",
                "unspentAmountE18": {
                  "hi": "1",
                  "lo": "1"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GetSwap",
          "path": "swap.v1.SwapService/GetSwap",
          "requestType": "swap.v1.GetSwapRequest",
          "responseType": "swap.v1.GetSwapResponse",
          "summary": "GetSwap returns one of the caller's Swaps by swap_id or idempotency key.",
          "doc": "GetSwap returns one of the caller's Swaps by swap_id or idempotency key.\n\n Errors:\n - INVALID_ARGUMENT: malformed selector.\n - NOT_FOUND: SWAP_NOT_FOUND.\n - PERMISSION_DENIED: SWAP_NOT_PERMITTED.\n - UNAVAILABLE: SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE; retry later.\n - UNAUTHENTICATED: missing or invalid credentials.",
          "authRequired": true,
          "authenticationMethods": [
            "session_token",
            "api_key"
          ],
          "mfaRequirement": "none",
          "stability": "stable",
          "errorProtoPkg": "swap.v1",
          "errorCatalog": "core:generic",
          "examples": {
